1
00:01:22,720 --> 00:01:24,688
I’m in my school’s baseball club,

2
00:01:25,056 --> 00:01:27,136
so I play baseball.quite often.

3
00:01:27,792 --> 00:01:29,280
It’s my favourite sport.

4
00:01:29,280 --> 00:01:31,408
We play many matches.

5
00:01:32,016 --> 00:01:33,616
The other teams are great,

6
00:01:33,856 --> 00:01:36,128
but I think ours is the best!

7
00:01:36,576 --> 00:01:39,728
We usually practise three times a week after school.

8
00:01:39,984 --> 00:01:44,576
We also exercise a lot because it keeps us fit and helps us play better.

9
00:01:45,232 --> 00:01:47,856
Baseball also builds team spirit.

10
00:01:48,320 --> 00:01:49,984
All of us are good friends,

11
00:01:50,336 --> 00:01:52,544
both on and off the field.

12
00:01:53,104 --> 00:01:56,640
We work as a team, and we win or lose as a team

